{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it's like to be a CCTV operator watching paranormal footage where you can die at any given moment? A life threatening job, for sure. But an exciting one nonetheless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your predecessor ended badly, but <u>will you</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Become a new Anomaly Observer today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.poster.avif?t=1774549517\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.webm?t=1774549517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/d5d104c81f31ac6a23c6c86cc7b939ba.mp4?t=1774549517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all cameras in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find changes happening while on shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive until 6 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.poster.avif?t=1774549517\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.webm?t=1774549517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793510/extras/30f8886aecc656c4b31713975d9850f7.mp4?t=1774549517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different areas where paranormal things are happening! <u>Each new area is more difficult, than the previous one.</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience weirdest phenomena and anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other Anomaly Observers in Leaderboards and become the best one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are more and more intensive as the contract goes on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No contract is the same - <u><strong>there are hundreds of different anomalies that can happen at any given time!</strong></u></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793510/a1bf16428852e66031b0c3783405b6e8c47166ff.jpg"},{"name":"No longer Homesick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793510/173a6d6d9b00f1418cedc094e0ce3a426b06efe2.jpg"},{"name":"Get Out Of Jail Free Card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793510/be6f088d3ca1257a14939e3a4dca4f4b158aef0a.jpg"},{"name":"Hospital Discharge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793510/805b5ec53d95b67b78b6ebd6218471d0b13cb246.jpg"},{"name":"Final Experiment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793510/b110738e7d6d3d57546517cc1a56b1368478c78a.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping Spree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793510/b3b6c78eeec2114d0e2eb6d88c30785a9a709745.jpg"},{"name":"Anomaly Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst